  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Capacity Building for SDGs (Asia) (2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve SDG implementation capacity of public officials and civil experts in Asia countries by offering knowledge and understanding about public and civil sector management big and small data analysis and public policy making process analysis&#xC870;&#xC9C1; &#xC778;&#xC0AC; &#xC7AC;&#xBB34; &#xC9C0;&#xBC29;&#xD589;&#xC815; &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xBD84;&#xC57C;&#xC758; &#xC774;&#xB860; &#xBC0F; &#xC2E4;&#xBB34; &#xC9C0;&#xC2DD; &#xC2B5;&#xB4DD;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD574; &#xC815;&#xBD80;&#xB97C; &#xBE44;&#xB86F;&#xD55C; &#xACF5;&#xACF5;&#xBD80;&#xBB38;&#xC758; &#xC815;&#xCC45;&#xC870;&#xC815; &#xB2A5;&#xB825; &#xB354; &#xB098;&#xC544;&#xAC00; &#xACF5;&#xC0AC; &#xD30C;&#xD2B8;&#xB108;&#xC2ED; &#xD655;&#xBCF4;&#xB97C; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xC5F0;&#xC218;&#xC0DD;&#xC758;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC; &#xBC0F; &#xC18C;&#xD1B5; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xC744; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xC2DC;&#xD0A4;&#xACE0;&#xC790; &#xD568;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To share the Korean models and experiences of SDG implementation provide practical knowledge of public management and public civil sector innovations that accelerated South Koreas growth and ultimately assist public and civil experts in successfully promoting SDG development in their countries</narrative>
  </description>
